00:41:37.880 --> 00:41:40.100
He has put on his Kangol hat.
他戴上了他的康格尔帽。

959
00:41:40.100 --> 00:41:44.520
The script specifically called for Michael to put on a Kangol hat.
剧本明确要求迈克尔戴上一顶康格尔帽。

960
00:41:44.800 --> 00:41:45.840
I got curious.
我很好奇。

961
00:41:45.920 --> 00:41:49.280
So for the second time, I became a lady who Googled.
所以这是我第二次化身为“谷歌女士”。

962
00:41:49.500 --> 00:41:50.000
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

963
00:41:50.760 --> 00:41:54.960
And I found out that the Kangol hats, which I was familiar with, has a long history.
我发现康格尔帽，也就是我熟悉的那种帽子，有着悠久的历史。

964
00:41:55.100 --> 00:41:55.940
It goes way back.
历史非常久远。

965
00:41:55.940 --> 00:42:01.480
Jack, a gentleman named Jacques Henry Durgan, a World War I soldier, returned from the war
杰克，一位名叫雅克·亨利·杜根的绅士，曾是一名一战士兵，他从战场归来后

966
00:42:01.480 --> 00:42:03.320
and he began designing berets.
开始设计贝雷帽。

967
00:42:03.920 --> 00:42:10.380
And in 1938, he started a company and his berets were worn by many British soldiers during
1938年，他创办了一家公司，他的贝雷帽在二战期间被许多英国士兵佩戴。

968
00:42:10.380 --> 00:42:11.160
World War II.
二战。

969
00:42:11.680 --> 00:42:13.840
He named his company Kangol.
他给自己的公司命名为康格尔。

970
00:42:14.160 --> 00:42:19.120
And in the 1960s, they got the rights to create all the hats worn by the Beatles.
20世纪60年代，他们获得了披头士乐队所戴所有帽子的制作权。

971
00:42:19.780 --> 00:42:20.220
What?
什么？

972
00:42:20.220 --> 00:42:20.800
Yeah.
是的。

973
00:42:21.560 --> 00:42:25.860
They distributed all headgear that bore the Beatles name or image.
他们分销了所有带有披头士名字或形象的头饰。

974
00:42:26.260 --> 00:42:26.900
Wow.
哇。

975
00:42:27.560 --> 00:42:36.940
In 1981, the brand enlisted a world-famous hat designer named Graham Smith to develop a luxurious
1981年，该品牌聘请了世界著名的帽子设计师格雷厄姆·史密斯，开发了一个既奢华

976
00:42:36.940 --> 00:42:40.780
yet affordable collection called Graham Smith for Kangol.
又实惠的系列，名为“格雷厄姆·史密斯为康格尔设计”。

977
00:42:41.020 --> 00:42:46.680
And in 1983, Princess Diana appeared in Vogue wearing one of those hats.
1983年，戴安娜王妃戴着其中一顶帽子登上了《Vogue》杂志。

978
00:42:46.680 --> 00:42:47.260
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

979
00:42:48.040 --> 00:42:51.620
Also, in 1983, they decided to create a logo.
同样是在1983年，他们决定设计一个标志。

980
00:42:52.160 --> 00:42:58.860
And because Americans kept asking for the kangaroo hat instead of the Kangol hat, they
因为美国人总是把康格尔帽叫成袋鼠帽，所以他们

981
00:42:58.860 --> 00:43:01.260
decided to make their logo a kangaroo.
决定把标志设计成一只袋鼠。

982
00:43:01.920 --> 00:43:08.540
Also, in the 1980s, MCs like Slick Rick and Run DMC started wearing Kangol in their videos
此外，在20世纪80年代，像斯里克·瑞克和Run DMC这样的说唱歌手开始在视频

983
00:43:08.540 --> 00:43:09.420
and on stage.
和舞台上佩戴康格尔帽。

984
00:43:09.420 --> 00:43:15.580
And they really rocketed to fame thanks to LL Cool J, who wore their Bermuda casual hat
他们真正声名鹊起要归功于LL Cool J，他在自己的专辑《Radio》封面上

985
00:43:15.580 --> 00:43:17.420
on his album cover for radio.
戴着他们的百慕大休闲帽。

986
00:43:18.200 --> 00:43:24.240
LL Cool J wore their hats all the time and really pushed it to the forefront of hip-hop
LL Cool J一直戴着他们的帽子，并真正将其推向了嘻哈时尚的

987
00:43:24.240 --> 00:43:24.740
fashion.
前沿。

988
00:43:24.740 --> 00:43:28.220
And then, you know, of course, Samuel L.
然后，你知道，当然还有塞缪尔·L·

989
00:43:28.340 --> 00:43:28.940
Jackson...
杰克逊……

990
00:43:28.940 --> 00:43:29.780
He loves them.
他很喜欢这些帽子。

991
00:43:29.960 --> 00:43:32.320
...well-known for loving his Kangol hat.
……以热爱他的康格尔帽而闻名。

992
00:43:32.500 --> 00:43:39.120
In 2012, he teamed up with the brand and created a line called Kangol Golf by Samuel L.
2012年，他与该品牌合作，推出了一个名为“康格尔高尔夫：塞缪尔·L·

993
00:43:39.280 --> 00:43:39.580
Jackson.
杰克逊”的系列。

994
00:43:39.700 --> 00:43:41.920
It was geared toward golf enthusiasts.
这是专门为高尔夫爱好者设计的。

995
00:43:42.820 --> 00:43:48.300
He loves these hats so much that in 2022, he was on The Tonight Show with Jimmy Fallon,
他太喜欢这些帽子了，以至于在2022年，他参加了吉米·法伦的《今夜秀》，

996
00:43:48.400 --> 00:43:50.220
and he talked about all his hats.
谈论了他所有的帽子。

997
00:43:50.460 --> 00:43:51.620
Here's an audio clip.
这是一段音频片段。

998
00:43:52.320 --> 00:43:55.440
Two, is it true that you own over 800 Kangol hats?
二，你真的拥有超过800顶康格尔帽吗？

999
00:43:56.120 --> 00:43:58.780
My wife got rid of about 500 of them.
我妻子处理掉了大约500顶。

1000
00:43:59.020 --> 00:43:59.380
Okay.
好吧。

1001
00:43:59.860 --> 00:44:00.860
So you're down to 300.
所以你现在只剩下300顶了。

1002
00:44:01.120 --> 00:44:01.560
I'm down to 300.
我只剩下300顶了。

1003
00:44:02.740 --> 00:44:03.960
When did you start wearing those?
你是什么时候开始戴那些帽子的？

1004
00:44:04.360 --> 00:44:05.000
Oh, geez.
噢，天哪。

1005
00:44:06.100 --> 00:44:09.220
When I stole my first one out of my grandfather's closet.
在我第一次从我祖父的衣柜里偷走一顶的时候。

1006
00:44:09.320 --> 00:44:09.560
Yeah.
是啊。

1007
00:44:09.820 --> 00:44:10.040
Yeah.
是啊。

1008
00:44:10.680 --> 00:44:11.300
Long time ago.
很久以前了。

1009
00:44:11.720 --> 00:44:12.840
Do you remember what color?
你还记得是什么颜色的吗？

1010
00:44:12.940 --> 00:44:13.100
Black?
黑色的？

1011
00:44:13.400 --> 00:44:14.280
My grandfather's?
我祖父的那顶？

1012
00:44:14.280 --> 00:44:14.360
Yeah.
对。

1013
00:44:14.580 --> 00:44:15.420
No, it was like a pla...
不，那是种像……

1014
00:44:15.420 --> 00:44:16.860
It was a plaid hat, you know?
那是顶格子呢帽，你知道吗？

1015
00:44:16.980 --> 00:44:18.240
It's one of those patterns.
就是那种花纹的。

1016
00:44:18.640 --> 00:44:19.360
It's stylish, too.
而且还挺时髦的。

1017
00:44:19.500 --> 00:44:19.600
Yeah.
是啊。

1018
00:44:19.680 --> 00:44:19.780
Yeah.
是啊。

1019
00:44:21.620 --> 00:44:21.920
How about that?
那又怎么样呢？

1020
00:44:22.200 --> 00:44:23.100
He has 300.
他有300顶。

1021
