They added all the music and arcade sounds in post-production,
所以听起来好像他们的游戏已经结束了，

1069
00:46:42.760 --> 00:46:45.420
so it sounds like their game has wound down,
但如果你仔细看屏幕，它还在运行。

1070
00:46:45.560 --> 00:46:47.340
but if you catch the screen, it's still going.
关于实际的游戏和我们当时在做什么，我有两件事要分享。

1071
00:46:47.340 --> 00:46:51.680
I have two things to share about the actual games and what we were doing.
布莱恩说他当时确实在玩那个赛车游戏，而且真的很好玩，

1072
00:46:52.320 --> 00:46:57.520
Brian said that he really was playing that racing game and that it was actually really fun,
他玩了好几个小时，因为他必须待在背景里。

1073
00:46:57.520 --> 00:47:00.160
and he played it for hours because he had to be in the background.
天哪。

1074
00:47:00.420 --> 00:47:01.140
Oh, my gosh.
然后在删减片段里，我觉得特别有意思。

1075
00:47:01.340 --> 00:47:04.220
And then in the deleted scenes, I thought it was so fun.
你会发现梅雷迪思其实很擅长打台球。

